  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Estimated number of people with latent TB infection (LTBI) in 2014, total population in 2014 and the resulting LTBI prevalence (%) with uncertainty ranges, for Brazil (BRA), the United Kingdom (GBR) and South Africa (ZAF).",
